    <worksheet name='Phase Funnel'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>IPF/PF Trial Volume by Development Phase</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>IPF/PF trial volume peaks at Phase 2 (146 trials) and drops sharply at Phase 3 (62 trials, only 42.5% retained), reflecting how few candidates show strong enough Phase 2 efficacy signal to justify Phase 3&apos;s cost — a pattern consistent with IPF&apos;s historical difficulty to treat. Note: Early Phase 1 is a rarely-used exploratory step most programs skip, so the jump to Phase 1 reflects standard trial volume, not attrition.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='phase_funnel' name='federated.0fc6q4e0ed1myf145f4so0ew8y7q' />
